# Ball_Flame - orange fire ball: a yellow flame decal with a pale-hot core.
# Ball family structure (see Ball_Basic.paint); ramp hue-shifts from yellow-white light to wine shadows.
size 32 32
key
  K #3e0c1c  ink (outer line, darkest of the ramp)
  k #7c1a26  outline on the lit side
  M #ff6a1c  ball base (icons.json color)
  s #dc3c1e  shadow / reflected light
  S #a41f2a  core shadow
  H #fff3b0  highlight and the flame's hot core
  Y #ffc93a  flame
  y #f7a02a  flame shade (edge and inside the shadow crescent)
strokes
  ellipse K 16 16 14.8 14.8
seeds
  M 16 16
ops
  band M s 1 1 7
  band M S 1 1 3
  band M s 1 1 1
# the flame: one tall tongue leaning left, a small tongue each side, a round belly with the hot core low
shade at 10 8
  .....Y......
  .....Yy.....
  ....YYY.....
  ....YYYy....
  ...YYYYy..Y.
  .Y.YYYYY.Yy.
  .YYYYYYYYYy.
  .YYYYYHYYYY.
  YYYYYHHYYYYy
  YYYYHHHHYYyy
  YYYYHHHHHyyy
  YYYYHHHHYyyy
  .YYYHHHYyyy.
  ..yYYyyyyy..
  ....yyyy....
shade at 6 5
  ....HH
  ..HHHH
  .HHHH.
  .HH...
ops
  edge K k -1 -1
  px k 2 19 19 2
  px K 3 23 23 3
